    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 0) Check the ticket is not already solved or closed\n\nRuns first, and on purpose does NOT post an internal note or reopen the ticket.\n\nWhy the guard: on 2026-07-23 Zendesk redelivered a ticket-created webhook 8h37m late. The automation re-ran on the original first email, found the refundable charges already consumed, and emailed the customer a refund rejection after having already granted the refund.\n\nWhy no internal note here: the shared Do not proceed path sets the ticket back to open. On a solved ticket that would re-queue it for agents and could re-fire the 2nd-message trigger.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "e8ba2470-e992-44ba-8311-05f768ecfe13",
