    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1b) Auto-solve emails\n\nSame matching logic as the blocklist (substring, case-insensitive, `active` respected), against **cs_email_autosolve**.\n\nOn a match the ticket is solved immediately with a private internal note and **no public comment**, so the customer is never notified.\n\nRuns AFTER the blocklist on purpose: if an address ends up on both lists, blocklist wins and a human looks at it.\n\nThe table is global and starts empty, so this branch is inert until a row is added - no per-brand config flag needed.",
